    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three cute girls get up to all sorts of trouble while trying to earn some cash, and naturally those evil Beasts are involved in some way. It's up to them to put a stop to this beastly menace as they journey across the...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUPER BEAST WORLD</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-FEATURES-</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced platforming gameplay. Chain together jumps, punches and dashes to platform like a pro.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A varied roster of Beasts to jump on, punch and get hurt by.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story of some sort. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a wacky cast of characters including an acrobat who tries to kill you, a slime girl who tries to kill you, and a cyclops who tries to kill you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through varied levels, from a crystaline canyon to a land made of cardboard to an alien infested farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden items for expert gamers to find in each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A room you can customise with the aftermentioned hidden items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the burger to a giant snake girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405090/extras/0b663eaf0e58304e2cd099633571009f.poster.avif?t=1753307669\" width=704 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405090/extras/0b663eaf0e58304e2cd099633571009f.webm?t=1753307669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>OH! We're all going to have an EMMY-RIFFIC time!</strong>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three cute girls get up to all sorts of trouble while trying to earn some cash, and naturally those evil Beasts are involved in some way. It's up to them to put a stop to this beastly menace as they journey across the...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUPER BEAST WORLD</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-FEATURES-</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced platforming gameplay. Chain together jumps, punches and dashes to platform like a pro.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A varied roster of Beasts to jump on, punch and get hurt by.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story of some sort. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a wacky cast of characters including an acrobat who tries to kill you, a slime girl who tries to kill you, and a cyclops who tries to kill you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through varied levels, from a crystaline canyon to a land made of cardboard to an alien infested farm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden items for expert gamers to find in each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A room you can customise with the aftermentioned hidden items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the burger to a giant snake girl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405090/extras/0b663eaf0e58304e2cd099633571009f.poster.avif?t=1753307669\" width=704 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3405090/extras/0b663eaf0e58304e2cd099633571009f.webm?t=1753307669\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>OH! We're all going to have an EMMY-RIFFIC time!</strong>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
